# Example: strong REAP lane on GPU1 only (llama.cpp or vLLM after promotion).
# Pair with vllm-reap-dual-fast.env.example on GPU0.
# Lab profile: scripts/model-lab/reap/profiles/dual-strong-glm47-reap-gpu1.env

# For vLLM promotion (cerebras/GLM-4.7-Flash-REAP-23B-A3B on GPU1 only):
